## al-02-loops: every X_eTaL line the video shows, run at the pinned commit.
## just eval prints what the video shows under each line.

## map, map-code: three times values
values := 2 4 6 8
tripled := 3 * values
tripled
## 6 12 18 24

## filter-mask: a comparison gives a mask
values > 5
## 0 0 1 1

## filter-code: replicate keeps what the mask says
(values > 5) r_eplicate values
## 6 8

## reduce: given plus, max, min
'+ r_/ values
## 20
'm_ax r_/ values
## 8
'm_in r_/ values
## 2

## count: adding a mask counts; and asks if all pass
'+ r_/ values > 5
## 2
'& r_/ values > 1
## 1

## compose: the loop's three jobs, one step each
big := (tripled > 5) r_eplicate tripled
'+ r_/ big
## 60
